{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05156","headline":"奉和圣制荅张说扈从南出雀鼠谷 · 赵冬曦","name":"奉和圣制荅张说扈从南出雀鼠谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轩辕应顺动，力牧正趋陪。\n道合殷爲砺，时行楚有材。\n省方西礼设，振旅北京回。\n地理分中壤，天文照上台。\n寒依汾谷去，春入晋郊来。\n窃比康衢者，长歌仰大哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}